//            act as a checkpoint while Risk measures to the next real destination.
//            Persistent TICK divergence becomes a warning—not a hard veto—only
//            when a strict 5m/15m/30m continuation context is independently proven.
// v24.5.6 — Fixed 5m RTH target reference; live HOD/LOD no longer chases price.
// v24.5.5 — Optional IB/Ext and GO Study rows disappear when disabled.
// v24.5.4 — Narrow three-line Risk row; confirmed 11-point dashboard.
// v24.5.3 — Status-first Risk row and simplified Volume Pace display.
// v24.5.2 — Centered RTH labels and score-watch alerts.
// v24.5.1 — Current RTH High/Low chart lines.
// v24.5   — Plain-English NYSE internals display.
// v24.4   — Honest 5m close confirmation and risk/diagnostic audit fixes.
// v24.3   — Optional close-armed GO, VWAP comparison, manual S/R merge.
// v24.2   — Manual historical S/R level and zone bank.
// v24.1   — TradingView-matched VWAP and structure-first stops.
